WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.803
This walkthrough shows contractors how to connect Stripe securely so they can accept customer payments and receive payouts through MyHomeBro.

00:00:09.403 --> 00:00:18.515
Open Stripe Onboarding from MyHomeBro. Stripe securely collects the business, identity, and payout details required for payment processing.

00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:28.907
Enter accurate legal business and identity information, then connect a payout bank account you control. Never use fictional details in a live Stripe account.

00:00:29.507 --> 00:00:39.394
Review each required section before submitting. Stripe may ask for supporting information. Keep bank, tax, and identity details inside the secure Stripe form.

00:00:39.994 --> 00:00:51.084
After submission, return to MyHomeBro and confirm that charges and payouts are enabled. If Stripe needs more information, follow the status prompt to finish setup.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:01:01.784
Once the account shows payment setup complete, Stripe is connected. You can now use eligible Direct Pay, protected funding, and progress payment workflows.
